#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:260
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:265
#, no-c-format
msgid "Who made this game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:266
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The kdegames team. You can find their website <ulink url=\"http://games.kde."
"org\">here</ulink>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:269
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where can I get cheatcodes?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:270
#, no-c-format
msgid "You cannot get cheatcodes for &kde; games."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:273
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I start a new game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:274
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can start a new game using the <guibutton>New</guibutton> button on the "
"toolbar, the <menuchoice><guimenu>Game</guimenu><guimenuitem>New</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu entry on the menubar or using the default "
"shortcut <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:279
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I pause the game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:280
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; does not have a <quote>Pause</quote> feature, as it does not "
"require one."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:284
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To change &kappname; visual theme you can use "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Theme</guisubmenu> </"
"menuchoice> option on the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:288
#, no-c-format
msgid "I have made a mistake. Can I undo?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:289
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To undo your last move you can use <menuchoice><shortcut><keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Z</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Move</guimenu><guimenuitem>Undo</guimenuitem></menuchoice> on the "
"menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:294
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use keyboard?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:295
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. The game of &kappname; cannot be played using keyboard."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:298
#, no-c-format
msgid "I cannot figure out what to do here! Are there hints?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:299
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To access 'Hint' feature use <menuchoice><shortcut><keysym>H</keysym></"
"shortcut><guimenu>Move</guimenu><guimenuitem>Hint</guimenuitem></menuchoice> "
"on the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:302
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have to quit the game now, but I am not finished yet. Can I save my "
"progress?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:303
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. There is no <quote>Save</quote> feature in &kappname;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:306
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where are the highscores?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:307
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kappname; does not have this feature."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:310
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the game configuration. Where do I go?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:311
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All of the possible &kappname;'s settings are located under the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu></menuchoice> on the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:314
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the toolbar layout. What do I do?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:315
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To change the toolbar layout please use <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure Toolbars...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> on the "
"menubar."
msgstr ""

